<div id="A7.p1" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<p id="A7.p1.1" class="ltx_p">We show some examples of the interface of the annotation tool in Fig. <a href="#A7.F18" title="Figure 18 ‣ Appendix G Screenshots of the Annotation App ‣ PRISMM-Bench: A Benchmark of Peer-Review Grounded Multimodal Inconsistencies" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">18</span></a> and Fig. <a href="#A7.F19" title="Figure 19 ‣ Appendix G Screenshots of the Annotation App ‣ PRISMM-Bench: A Benchmark of Peer-Review Grounded Multimodal Inconsistencies" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">19</span></a>.</p>
</div>
<figure id="A7.F18" class="ltx_figure"><img src="2510.16505v1/annotation_app-1.png" id="A7.F18.g1" class="ltx_graphics ltx_centering ltx_img_portrait" style="aspect-ratio:548/839;" width="548" height="839" alt="Refer to caption">
