<section id="A8" class="ltx_appendix">
<h2 class="ltx_title ltx_title_appendix"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_appendix">Appendix H </span>Screenshots of the Survey App</h2>

<div id="A8.p1" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<p id="A8.p1.1" class="ltx_p">We show some examples of the interface of the survey web interface in Fig. <a href="#A8.F20" title="Figure 20 ‣ Appendix H Screenshots of the Survey App ‣ PRISMM-Bench: A Benchmark of Peer-Review Grounded Multimodal Inconsistencies" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">20</span></a>, Fig. <a href="#A8.F21" title="Figure 21 ‣ Appendix H Screenshots of the Survey App ‣ PRISMM-Bench: A Benchmark of Peer-Review Grounded Multimodal Inconsistencies" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">21</span></a> and Fig. <a href="#A8.F22" title="Figure 22 ‣ Appendix H Screenshots of the Survey App ‣ PRISMM-Bench: A Benchmark of Peer-Review Grounded Multimodal Inconsistencies" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">22</span></a>.</p>
</div>
<figure id="A8.F20" class="ltx_figure"><img src="2510.16505v1/survey-app-0.png" id="A8.F20.g1" class="ltx_graphics ltx_centering ltx_img_landscape" style="aspect-ratio:548/388;" width="548" height="388" alt="Refer to caption">
<figcaption class="ltx_caption ltx_centering"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_figure">Figure 20: </span>First part of survey interface showing a question with no context provided.</figcaption>
</figure>
<figure id="A8.F21" class="ltx_figure"><img src="2510.16505v1/survey-app-1.png" id="A8.F21.g1" class="ltx_graphics ltx_centering ltx_img_portrait" style="aspect-ratio:548/775;" width="548" height="775" alt="Refer to caption">
<figcaption class="ltx_caption ltx_centering"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_figure">Figure 21: </span>Second part of survey interface showing question with <span id="A8.F21.3" class="ltx_text ltx_font_italic">Focused Context</span>.</figcaption>
</figure>
